<title>FRANCE: EU nations puts 96 grain crop at 203.5 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>EU nations puts 96 grain crop at 203.5 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 15 members of the European Union are targeting a 1996 grain crop of 203.5 million tonnes, including 90.5 million tonnes of soft wheat, member country officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>EU nations see EU grain exports potentially reaching 20.4 million tonnes, including 12.1 million tonnes for soft wheat exports, they said</p>
<p>The estimates were submitted by member states last week but have not been officially endorsed by the European Commission.</p>
</text>
